OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA rather
OL,6,Fcloudy evening although still rather
OL,7,Fbright, cloud will thicken later
OL,8,Fallowing for the odd spot of light
OL,9,Frain, most likely further west. Light
OL,10,Fto moderate winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FTurning very warm and humid on
OL,13,FMonday. Some sunshine, though an
OL,14,Fincreasing chance of showers,
OL,15,Fprimarily through the afternoon. These
OL,16,Fpotentially thundery at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
